        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 11 Kilkee Drive, Walkinstown, Dublin 12 to the market a superb three-bedroom end of terrace family home ideally positioned within this mature and ever-popular residential development. Kilkee Drive is a highly sought-after address, renowned for its convenience and family-friendly surroundings. A wealth of local amenities are within easy reach including Ashleaf Shopping Centre, SuperValu Walkinstown, an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local shops, together with a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools. The area is exceptionally well connected with numerous Dublin Bus routes servicing the immediate vicinity, while the M50, N7 and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible.\n\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 87 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, spacious lounge, dining room, and kitchen on the ground floor, while upstairs hosts three generous bedrooms and a main family bathroom. The property offers a practical layout with excellent scope to reconfigure and modernise to suit a variety of lifestyles.\n\nNo. 11 is presented as a clean blank canvas and is in need of modernisation throughout, offering the successful purchaser a fantastic opportunity to create a wonderful family home finished to their own taste and specification. The property further benefits from off street parking via a private driveway to the front and comes to the market with the added advantage of no onward chain, ensuring a smooth and straightforward purchase.\n\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, investor or growing family looking for a property with endless potential in a well-established location, No. 11 represents an outstanding opportunity. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n\n• c. 87 sqm\n• BER F\n• 3 Bed / 1 Bath\n• End of terrace home \n• Gas heating\n• Block built shed to the rear\n• Sunny rear garden\n• Presented as a blank canvas in need of modernisation \n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout \n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance \n• Highly sought after location \n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\nMeasurements;\nHallway: 1.79m X 3.18m. \nLiving Room: 3.86m X 4.19m. \nKitchen: 2.79m X 3.47m. \nDining Area: 2.97m X 3.47m. \nBedroom 1: 2.87m X 2.83m. \nBedroom 2: 3.87m X 4.31m. \nBedroom 3: 2.48m X 3.16m. \nBathroom: 2.17m X 1.70m. \n\nDirections;\nEircode: D12 X7NY\n"
      },
